// and reads `false` until checked and whenever the check itself fails -- an
// availability that cannot be established is never assumed. A capability
// called anyway raises `ForbiddenError`, never a silent substitute. A picker
// the user cancels, or denies camera or photo access to, answers `null`.
// Nothing here logs a picked file, a position or a token.

